  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kupakwashe Cattle Fattening Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Food Production (Beef).Beneficiaries: cattle farmers.Summary: The project funds will be used to hire office staff; train staff in good governance practices; purchase accounting software and train staff in financial management; develop policies for finances; human resources; and procurement; hire consultants to develop business and marketing plans; purchaseoffice equipment; and capitalize the pen fattening project with appropriate beef herds.</narrative>
  </description>
